        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-12-03T15:20:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we should honour or set the global proxy here at all. This method is completely bound to a given Network, and its documentation explicitly promises that it will only send traffic on the Network. But the global proxy certainly won\u0027t know that it needs to send all traffic on that Network, and in fact it might not even be reachable from that Network at all.\n\nFor example, consider an app that needs to send an MMS on a network that can only reach the MMS server but not the Internet. Such an app would not be able to use this method.",
      "revId": "8fbcb6be0d56ab0fd2c0872bca0628d3ad100577",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
